  speaker: {fileID: 0}
  messageText: "And how could I forget Cliff? Every bar has its own alcoholic to
    help keep them in business, and The Copper Pot has Cliff. I don\u2019t know what
    he does for a living, but he must get up early every day to get in the state
    that he\u2019s in by the time I get here. Either that or he\u2019s an eccentric
    millionaire\u2026"
